Modifications made by this project (see patches/):
- MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKShaderModule.mm: before compiling a non-vertex shader,
  remove [[clang::optnone]] from SPIRV-Cross's precise-math helper functions
  (spvFAdd, spvFSub, spvFMul, spvFMulVectorMatrix, spvFMulMatrixVector,
  spvFMulMatrixMatrix). Disable at runtime with MVK_PERF_OPTIMIZE_PRECISE_MATH=0.

